# Per-host dinit environment for kmscon-Wayland. Optional clipboard bridge.
# Set to the Unix socket used by the Wayland user-session peer.
# Example for a user with UID 1000 (replace UID as needed):
# KMSCON_CLIPBOARD_SOCKET=/run/user/1000/kmscon-clipboard-wayland-c4.sock
# Enable/reload/restart kmscon-Wayland manually only after peer is available.
